{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59a6fca4f66dad179862ba5e2185eb0e4bbb43d9d95ce202bacdf345565188a7", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。美希と一緒にカフェへやって来た\nのだが……。なんだか仕事の電話が多いな……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。和美希一起来了咖啡店，\n可是……工作上的电话怎么这么多……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "aa6d5990c687eb087a82da3435334dbf645318f48e6173003c6265d735df05a1", "ja": "む～……。電話、やっと終わった？", "zh": "唔～……电话终于打完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6ab2f73843fc3bbb1a943a468c792d96180965a952a5cc2f7347c3d0cde6f356", "ja": "すまん！\nイベントのスタッフさんから緊急の連絡で……。", "zh": "抱歉！\n活动工作人员那边有紧急联系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "bab23939321a87c6e6a8948d895a256083b8a02a1247eb0d6daa8779f9e0b376", "ja": "……ねえ、{$P$}。\nなんでミキが怒ってるか、わかってる？", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}。\n你明白美希为什么生气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c89123a40102d3f7d7ff15522a40fdcf06c9803c507bc7aa6e52895e412d89fa", "ja": "え？　それは……。\n電話の間、ずっと待たせてたからじゃないのか……？", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……  \n是因为打电话的时候，让她一直等着吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "5178272d6b788f901ec8122a5e67accd664dbe28237c40098dc9634e094c6f84", "ja": "もう、違うの！　なんでミキとのデートより、\nお仕事の方を優先しちゃうの？", "zh": "真是的，才不是那样呢！为什么比起和美希约会，\n会去优先选择工作啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "d555f4dac080919d741a57af144656244af090afd03cbcb1ded8daf1fa092b27", "ja": "つまんないのもヤだけど……\nミキが怒ってるのは、そっちなの！", "zh": "无聊也很讨厌，可是……\n美希生气的是后面那件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a9be0dbd0219c0f2299876093b9930db644d3a6ae60a652663a90dfd5472c8cc", "ja": "美希……。\n本当に、すまなかった……。", "zh": "美希……真的很抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "907391ddbf77fae1335893c2228374719524f8eed76ed9cc22c3eabcb3809af9", "ja": "ミキね、すっごく楽しみにしてたんだよ？\n{$P$}とのデート。", "zh": "美希可是一直特别期待的哦？\n和{$P$}约会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "9b9f4c9d7043d74bce32140417b7df0eb19c6fb6e432b89b857bfcfa6f37a6c7", "ja": "なのに、ミキに会ったら、すぐにお仕事の話するし……\n今だって、電話に出ちゃうし……。", "zh": "可是，明明一见到美希，就马上开始聊工作的事……\n现在也是，居然还接电话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "a8264f2e284000a7871a38e30dc0af8ad17f8147b6350b2373851cadce435f7d", "ja": "楽しみにしてたのは、ミキだけだったのかな？", "zh": "期待这件事的，只有美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a64a58a060b7ac9855ee95dfe24b48619e7315bc2829afc829cdab77c4a75b04", "ja": "そんなことないぞ！\n今更で説得力はないかもしれないが……。", "zh": "当然不是！\n虽然现在才这么说，可能没什么说服力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc20c8d6b2283d9d046e035be190cfbd897fa45f7614b3c23e0ce425afa53d65", "ja": "こうして、美希と過ごすのは久しぶりだろ？\nゆっくりといろんな話がしたいと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "像这样和美希一起度过时光，已经很久没有过了吧？\n我一直都想和你好好聊聊各种事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "4e94b6a4fc8b18961b1b1879cf40ab64595279541aeff56ec69863242284bb06", "ja": "……ホントに？　じゃあ、もうミキをひとりにしない？\nお仕事の電話に出たりしない？", "zh": "……真的吗？那，不会再丢下美希一个人了吧？\n也不会接工作的电话了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2a5519b87379f40418f55e9420bea7e86caf71451f1db5818a8182a466dde24f", "ja": "うっ。それは……。", "zh": "呃，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "7ab2aa22e9c866783734a144f3a303f038028307acd688fa5dce5bba1a41e701", "ja": "むーっ。\n約束してくれないなら、ミキ、帰るっ！", "zh": "唔——\n要是不跟我约好的话，美希就要回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ef5919458bd874a3d236d24800653d1b3c4b1818a2ee2167305c0b049018386c", "ja": "ええっ！？　わかった。約束するよ。\nこうなったら……えいっ！", "zh": "诶！？好吧，我答应你。\n既然这样……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_1017", "source_sha256": "f449b29e196815265f30d59668b1a0e32a7f4ae79af4972866b3c933461bcd9c", "ja": "携帯の電源を切る", "zh": "关闭手机电源", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_2000_003mik", "source_sha256": "358b092d3b60d137c8f8820412da217aa57974afb8319cd96feff25e60b98e08", "ja": "……えっ？\n{$P$}……いいの？", "zh": "……诶？\n{$P$}……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_2001_p", "source_sha256": "aa156ac19352c2e1d9c4a1a56b60ae9dd672f3ad7740b8bc65093a46cc622391", "ja": "うーん……あまり良くはない、かな……。\nでも、今、大事なのは美希との時間だから。", "zh": "嗯……不算太好吧……。\n不过，现在最重要的是和美希相处的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "e497b5a75d08594a3679dc550af0f29d926a7752d6fb0af7d1c2e708b99b37aa", "ja": "ハニー……。えへへ、ありがとうなの。\nそれとごめんね、ワガママばっかり言って。", "zh": "亲爱的……嘿嘿，谢谢你。\n还有，对不起，总是这么任性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_2003_003mik", "source_sha256": "2982c2aaa3a6aa7ccc144120ff66c35b5ceced2dc20d9df88f55b1b425161e6f", "ja": "せっかくのデートの思い出が、ケンカとかイヤなの。\nだから、この話はこれでおしまい！", "zh": "难得的约会回忆，我不想让它被争吵什么的破坏。\n所以，这件事就到此为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "b68e63b80c33928c36f79d473ede57e7e1f3db03856617a04f6f073a58848769", "ja": "その代わり……もうミキ以外、気にしちゃダメだよ？\nミキも、ずっとハニーだけ見てるからね♪", "zh": "不过……以后除了美希，谁都不许在意哦？\n美希也会一直只看着亲爱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0374_2005_p", "source_sha256": "6c47a2767ad3d83350d7d7085cf6605f74d734f98ea0df12857775b143e80433", "ja": "（どうにか美希の機嫌が直ったみたいでよかった。\n仕事のことは……今は、考えないようにしよう……）", "zh": "（美希好像总算恢复心情了，太好了。\n工作的事……现在还是先别想了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
